# {{ theme.name }} Nix Templates

These templates generate Nix attrsets for Home Manager module integration.

## Generated Files

- {% for v in variants %}`{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}-fzf.nix`{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}{% endfor %} - fzf colors for `programs.fzf.colors`
- {% for v in variants %}`{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}-gh-dash.nix`{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}{% endfor %} - gh-dash theme for `programs.gh-dash.settings`

## Usage

These files are imported by the Home Manager module in `nix/targets/`.
See the main README for Home Manager integration instructions.
